{"id":"n76347-1-8","stage":5,"title":"조성 · 建设","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n76347-1-8-1","ko":"공터에 뭐가 새로 생기는 거야?","zh":"空地上要新建什么吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공터에","meaning":"空地，闲地","explanation":"공터：空地，闲地；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"공터","audio":"/audio/78d9062079de227d934f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15285","senseId":"1","lemma":"공터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새로","meaning":"新","explanation":"새로：新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생기는","meaning":"有，出现","explanation":"생기다：有，出现；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"1","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"78d9062079de227d","term":"공터","zh":"空地，闲地","audio":"/audio/78d9062079de227d934f.mp3","entryId":"15285","definition":"没有房子或农田的空土地。","pronunciation":["공터"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"从前没有而首次。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"有，出现","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"新增了原本没有的东西。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"66342","definition":"指代与听话人较近的或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/8f2e7fc91bf240544cef.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n76347-1-8-2","ko":"놀이공원 조성이 예정되어 있어.","zh":"那里计划要建一个游乐园。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"놀이공원","meaning":"游乐园，游乐场","explanation":"놀이공원：游乐园，游乐场","readings":[{"term":"놀이공원","audio":"/audio/c665e4a5f02e31f2eacc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90233","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀이공원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조성이","meaning":"建设","explanation":"조성：建设；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"조성","audio":"/audio/04caeeee77170ca80a22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76347","senseId":"1","lemma":"조성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예정되어","meaning":"预定","explanation":"예정되다：预定；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"예정되다","audio":"/audio/a23ef7e2d29e5053d530.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14186","senseId":"1","lemma":"예정되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c665e4a5f02e31f2","term":"놀이공원","zh":"游乐园，游乐场","audio":"/audio/c665e4a5f02e31f2eacc.mp3","entryId":"90233","definition":"拥有各种供人们观看或乘坐游玩的设施及娱乐器材的地方。","pronunciation":["노리공원"]},{"id":"04caeeee77170ca8","term":"조성","zh":"建设","audio":"/audio/04caeeee77170ca80a22.mp3","entryId":"76347","definition":"建造而形成某物。","pronunciation":["조ː성"]},{"id":"a23ef7e2d29e5053","term":"예정되다","zh":"预定","audio":"/audio/a23ef7e2d29e5053d530.mp3","entryId":"14186","definition":"即将做的事被提前定下或预想。","pronunciation":["예ː정되다","예ː정뒈다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果